        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171616930?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Description</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR improves the “Promise terminology” section for better readability and clarity. The section has been restructured, and definitions have been simplified to be more accessible for learners.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Motivation</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This change addresses a suggestion from a maintainer in issue <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3515875033\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41538\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41538/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41538\">#41538</a> to update the terminology section. The main goal is to resolve an inconsistency in the article by adding a definition for the term “completed” and explaining its relationship to “settled.”</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related issues</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #41538.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3515875033\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41538\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41538/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41538\">#41538</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41565",
            "title": "Docs: Improve and clarify Promise terminology section",
            "date_modified": "2025-10-17T20:24:25.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-10-16T17:57:27.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "amritamishra01",
                "url": "https://github.com/amritamishra01"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds documentation and a release note describing the support for the masque proxy option in the proxy API. This covers the dev-doc-needed request for <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1988988\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1988988</a> Add extension API support for masque proxy.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related BCD changes in PR <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3522646651\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28213\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28213/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28213\">mdn/browser-compat-data#28213</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41563",
            "title": "Bug 1988988 `proxy` API support for masque",
            "date_modified": "2025-10-16T16:47:06.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-10-16T16:12:47.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "rebloor",
                "url": "https://github.com/rebloor"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 142 adds support for the WebGPU <code class=\"notranslate\">texture-formats-tier1</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">texture-formats-tier2</code> features. See <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5116926821007360\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5116926821007360</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds documentation for the new features and the feature sets behind them. It also adds in an <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41553#pullrequestreview-3343866178\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/41553/hovercard\">edit suggestion</a> from <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3521013523\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41553\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/41553/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41553\">#41553</a> that was missed.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41557",
            "title": "Editorial review: Document WebGPU Tier 1 and Tier 2 texture formats",
            "date_modified": "2025-10-17T13:42:53.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-10-16T11:42:15.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "chrisdavidmills",
                "url": "https://github.com/chrisdavidmills"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37013688?u=2614f4d310c2b39ff3633b0b016acbfacab5c3c4&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Faced an issue with the threshold explanation. The intersection observer callback is actually triggered when the targetRect \"touches\" the <code class=\"notranslate\">rootBounds</code>. So I tried to add this detail here in the docs.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Looking at the definition options <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/IntersectionObserver/#intersection-observer-init\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/IntersectionObserver/#intersection-observer-init</a>, I can see</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong><code class=\"notranslate\">threshold</code>, of type <code class=\"notranslate\">(double or sequence&lt;double&gt;)</code>, defaulting to <code class=\"notranslate\">0</code></strong><br>\nList of threshold(s) at which to trigger callback. <em><code class=\"notranslate\">callback</code> will be invoked when intersectionRect’s area changes from greater than or equal to any threshold to less than that threshold, and vice versa</em>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Also, looking at <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/IntersectionObserver/#update-intersection-observations-algo\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/IntersectionObserver/#update-intersection-observations-algo</a></p>\n<blockquote>\n<ol start=\"11\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Let isIntersecting be true if targetRect and rootBounds intersect <em>or are edge-adjacent</em>, even if the intersection has zero area (because rootBounds or targetRect have zero area).</li>\n</ol>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The original explanation did not represent the actual behavior</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>Simple code reproduction</summary>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-text-html-basic notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\n&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;head&gt;\n    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot; /&gt;\n    &lt;title&gt;Intersection Observer Simple Demo&lt;/title&gt;\n    &lt;style&gt;\n      .container {\n        width: 300px;\n        height: 300px;\n        overflow-y: auto;\n      }\n      .page {\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 300px;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        font-size: 2em;\n        color: white;\n      }\n      .page1 {\n        background: #4287f5;\n      }\n      .page2 {\n        background: #42f57b;\n      }\n      .page3 {\n        background: #f5a142;\n      }\n    &lt;/style&gt;\n  &lt;/head&gt;\n  &lt;body&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;container&quot; id=&quot;container&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;page page1&quot; id=&quot;page1&quot;&gt;Page 1&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;page page2&quot; id=&quot;page2&quot;&gt;Page 2&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;page page3&quot; id=&quot;page3&quot;&gt;Page 3&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div id=&quot;log&quot; style=&quot;font-family: monospace; margin-top: 10px&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;script&gt;\n      const log = document.getElementById('log');\n      function logger(txt) {\n        log.innerHTML = log.innerHTML + '&lt;br/&gt;' + txt;\n      }\n\n      const THRESHOLD = 0;\n\n      function getLastIntersectionObserverEntry(entries) {\n        return entries[entries.length - 1];\n      }\n\n      function handleViewability({ page, isViewable }) {\n        logger(`Page: ${page} isViewable: ${isViewable}`);\n      }\n\n      document.querySelectorAll('.page').forEach((pageDiv) =&gt; {\n        const observer = new IntersectionObserver(\n          (entries) =&gt; {\n            const lastEntry = getLastIntersectionObserverEntry(entries);\n            if (!lastEntry) return;\n\n            // Following @initViewabilityTrackers.ts\n            const isViewable =\n              lastEntry.isIntersecting &amp;&amp;\n              lastEntry.intersectionRatio &gt;= THRESHOLD;\n\n            handleViewability({\n              page: pageDiv.textContent,\n              isViewable,\n            });\n          },\n          {\n            root: document.getElementById('container'),\n            threshold: THRESHOLD,\n          }\n        );\n\n        observer.observe(pageDiv);\n      });\n      document.querySelectorAll('.page').forEach((p) =&gt; observer.observe(p));\n    &lt;/script&gt;\n  &lt;/body&gt;\n&lt;/html&gt;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">&lt;!DOCTYPE html<span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">html</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">lang</span>=\"<span class=\"pl-s\">en</span>\"<span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">head</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">meta</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">charset</span>=\"<span class=\"pl-s\">UTF-8</span>\" <span class=\"pl-kos\">/&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">title</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>Intersection Observer Simple Demo<span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">title</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">style</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n      .<span class=\"pl-c1\">container</span> {\n        <span class=\"pl-c1\">width</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">:</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">300<span class=\"pl-smi\">px</span></span>;\n        <span class=\"pl-c1\">height</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">:</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">300<span class=\"pl-smi\">px</span></span>;\n        <span class=\"pl-c1\">overflow-y</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">:</span> auto;\n      }\n      .<span class=\"pl-c1\">page</span> {\n        <span class=\"pl-c1\">width</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">:</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">100<span class=\"pl-smi\">%</span></span>;\n        <span class=\"pl-c1\">height</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">:</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">300<span class=\"pl-smi\">px</span></span>;\n        <span class=\"pl-c1\">display</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">:</span> flex;\n        <span class=\"pl-c1\">align-items</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">:</span> center;\n        <span class=\"pl-c1\">justify-content</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">:</span> center;\n        <span class=\"pl-c1\">font-size</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">:</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">2<span class=\"pl-smi\">em</span></span>;\n        <span class=\"pl-c1\">color</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">:</span> white;\n      }\n      .<span class=\"pl-c1\">page1</span> {\n        <span class=\"pl-c1\">background</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">:</span> <span class=\"pl-pds\"><span class=\"pl-kos\">#</span>4287f5</span>;\n      }\n      .<span class=\"pl-c1\">page2</span> {\n        <span class=\"pl-c1\">background</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">:</span> <span class=\"pl-pds\"><span class=\"pl-kos\">#</span>42f57b</span>;\n      }\n      .<span class=\"pl-c1\">page3</span> {\n        <span class=\"pl-c1\">background</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">:</span> <span class=\"pl-pds\"><span class=\"pl-kos\">#</span>f5a142</span>;\n      }\n    <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">style</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">head</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">body</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">div</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">class</span>=\"<span class=\"pl-s\">container</span>\" <span class=\"pl-c1\">id</span>=\"<span class=\"pl-s\">container</span>\"<span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">div</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">class</span>=\"<span class=\"pl-s\">page page1</span>\" <span class=\"pl-c1\">id</span>=\"<span class=\"pl-s\">page1</span>\"<span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>Page 1<span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">div</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">div</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">class</span>=\"<span class=\"pl-s\">page page2</span>\" <span class=\"pl-c1\">id</span>=\"<span class=\"pl-s\">page2</span>\"<span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>Page 2<span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">div</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">div</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">class</span>=\"<span class=\"pl-s\">page page3</span>\" <span class=\"pl-c1\">id</span>=\"<span class=\"pl-s\">page3</span>\"<span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>Page 3<span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">div</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">div</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">div</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">id</span>=\"<span class=\"pl-s\">log</span>\" <span class=\"pl-c1\">style</span>=\"<span class=\"pl-s\">font-family: monospace; margin-top: 10px</span>\"<span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">div</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">script</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">log</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">document</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">getElementById</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">'log'</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">logger</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">txt</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"pl-s1\">log</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">innerHTML</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">log</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">innerHTML</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span> <span class=\"pl-s\">'&lt;br/&gt;'</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">+</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">txt</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span>\n\n      <span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">THRESHOLD</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">0</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n\n      <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">getLastIntersectionObserverEntry</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">entries</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"pl-k\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">entries</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">[</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">entries</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">length</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">-</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">1</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">]</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span>\n\n      <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">handleViewability</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span> page<span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span> isViewable <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"pl-en\">logger</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">`Page: <span class=\"pl-s1\"><span class=\"pl-kos\">${</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">page</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span></span> isViewable: <span class=\"pl-s1\"><span class=\"pl-kos\">${</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">isViewable</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span></span>`</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span>\n\n      <span class=\"pl-smi\">document</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">querySelectorAll</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">'.page'</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">forEach</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">pageDiv</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">observer</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">new</span> <span class=\"pl-v\">IntersectionObserver</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span>\n          <span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">entries</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">lastEntry</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">getLastIntersectionObserverEntry</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">entries</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n            <span class=\"pl-k\">if</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">!</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">lastEntry</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">return</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n\n            <span class=\"pl-c\">// Following <span class=\"pl-k\">@initViewabilityTrackers</span>.ts</span>\n            <span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">isViewable</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span>\n              <span class=\"pl-s1\">lastEntry</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">isIntersecting</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">&amp;&amp;</span>\n              <span class=\"pl-s1\">lastEntry</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">intersectionRatio</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">&gt;=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">THRESHOLD</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n\n            <span class=\"pl-en\">handleViewability</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n              <span class=\"pl-c1\">page</span>: <span class=\"pl-s1\">pageDiv</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">textContent</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span>\n              isViewable<span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n          <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span>\n          <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"pl-c1\">root</span>: <span class=\"pl-smi\">document</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">getElementById</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">'container'</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"pl-c1\">threshold</span>: <span class=\"pl-c1\">THRESHOLD</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span>\n          <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n\n        <span class=\"pl-s1\">observer</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">observe</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">pageDiv</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-smi\">document</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">querySelectorAll</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">'.page'</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">forEach</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">p</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">observer</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">observe</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">p</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">script</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">body</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-kos\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"pl-ent\">html</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">&gt;</span></pre></div>\n</details>",
